    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Index.ravel#\n\n- \n*final* Index.ravel(*order='C'* )[source]#\n- Return a view on self. \n  - Returns:\n    - Index\n See also \n  - `numpy.ndarray.ravel`\n  - Return a flattened array.\n Examples >>> s = pd.Series([1, 2, 3], index=['a', 'b', 'c']) >>> s.index.ravel() Index(['a', 'b', 'c'], dtype='object')",
